---
---
<section id="ways">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid head">
      <h2 class="h2 c-l6">Three more ways an alarm starts</h2>
      <p class="lead c-r">The parent never has to decide they are being scammed. Each alarm starts from something that happened, and lands in the same room.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ways after-head">
      <article class="way grid" data-reveal>
        <div class="c-l">
          <h3 class="h3">A ride alone at night</h3>
          <p class="soft measure gap">Before an Ola, Uber, Rapido or auto ride, anyone in the group writes how long it should take and pastes the app's share-trip message. It runs only when someone starts it.</p>
          <p class="small soft measure gap-s">A code word, <code>@ride-watch pizza</code>, raises the alarm at once, for when she can't talk freely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="c-r vis">
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li><span class="from">Riya<small>family</small></span><div class="body"><p>@ride-watch 25 min</p></div></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="route" data-route>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 600 110" aria-hidden="true">
              <path class="soft-line" d="M8 80 C 110 80, 130 24, 240 30 S 400 96, 500 70 S 570 30, 592 30" />
              <path class="ink-line" data-route-path d="M8 80 C 110 80, 130 24, 240 30 S 400 96, 500 70 S 570 30, 592 30" />
              <circle class="ink-fill" cx="8" cy="80" r="4" />
              <rect class="ink-line paper-fill" x="584" y="22" width="16" height="16" />
              <circle class="stamp-fill" data-route-car r="5" cx="8" cy="80" />
            </svg>
            <div class="route-ends meta"><span>pickup</span><span>home</span></div>
          </div>
          <ol class="ticks" aria-label="What happens if Riya doesn't say she reached">
            <li><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>25 min</b><span class="small soft">Expected arrival</span></li>
            <li><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>+10 min</b><span class="small soft">Ride watch asks if she reached</span></li>
            <li class="a"><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>+5 min</b><span class="small soft">Alarm, with the driver's details</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="way grid" data-reveal>
        <div class="c-l">
          <h3 class="h3">A missed call</h3>
          <p class="soft measure gap">Mom saves the family's number as "Family SOS". When a caller scares her, she gives it a missed call. Call watch rejects the call, so it costs her nothing.</p>
          <p class="small soft measure gap-s">One tap on a number she already knows how to dial. No app, no typing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="c-r vis">
          <div class="call" data-call>
            <svg viewBox="-60 -60 120 120" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle class="ink-line" data-call-ring r="14" />
              <circle class="ink-line" data-call-ring r="14" />
              <circle class="ink-line" data-call-ring r="14" />
              <rect class="ink-fill" x="-10" y="-10" width="20" height="20" />
              <path class="stamp-line cut" data-call-cut d="M-26 26 L26 -26" />
            </svg>
            <div class="call-text">
              <p class="meta">Mom's phone → Family SOS</p>
              <p class="h4" data-call-status>Ringing</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li data-call-post><span class="from">Call watch<small>service, no AI</small></span><div class="body"><p>Mom gave a missed call. Who's calling Mom?</p></div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="way grid" data-reveal>
        <div class="c-l">
          <h3 class="h3">A question that is really a scam</h3>
          <p class="soft measure gap">Many scams reach a parent as an ordinary "how do I…" question. Line checks every request against a danger list before helping, and answers in the language the parent writes in.</p>
          <p class="small soft measure gap-s">Runs on Switch's WhatsApp and SMS adapters, which are open pull requests. Everything else on this page runs on Switch as released.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="c-r vis">
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li><span class="from">Papa<small>on WhatsApp</small></span><div class="body"><p>bank wale bol rahe AnyDesk download karo</p></div></li>
            <li>
              <span class="from">Line<small>AI agent</small></span>
              <div class="body">
                <div class="langs" role="tablist" aria-label="Line's reply language">
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-hl" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="p-hl">Hinglish</button>
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-hi" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p-hi" tabindex="-1"><span class="deva" lang="hi">हिन्दी</span></button>
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-en" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p-en" tabindex="-1">English</button>
                </div>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-hl" aria-labelledby="t-hl">Kripya rukiye. Koi asli bank, police ya company kabhi app download karne ya code batane ko nahi kehti. Yeh dhokha hai. Phone par aur kuch mat kijiye. Madad ke liye 1930 par call karein. Main aapke parivaar ko bata raha hoon, woh aapko phone karenge.</p>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-hi" aria-labelledby="t-hi" class="deva" lang="hi" hidden>कृपया रुकिए। कोई असली बैंक, पुलिस या कंपनी कभी ऐप डाउनलोड करने या कोड बताने को नहीं कहती। यह धोखा है। फ़ोन पर और कुछ मत कीजिए। मदद के लिए 1930 पर कॉल करें। मैं आपके परिवार को बता रहा हूँ, वे आपको फ़ोन करेंगे।</p>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-en" aria-labelledby="t-en" hidden>Please stop. No real bank, police or company ever asks you to install an app or share a code. This is a scam. Don't do anything more on the phone. You can call 1930 for help. I'm telling your family now, they will call you.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="from">Line<small>in the family group</small></span>
              <div class="body"><p><span class="alarm">Line alarm: Papa may be in a scam</span><br>He wrote: "bank wale bol rahe AnyDesk download karo"<br>Matches: screen-sharing app asked for by a "bank" caller<br>I told him to stop, gave 1930, and said you'll call.</p><p>@guardian over to you.</p></div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.langs [role="tab"]')];
  const select = (tab: HTMLButtonElement) =>
    tabs.forEach((t) => {
      const on = t === tab;
      t.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(on));
      t.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
      document.getElementById(t.getAttribute("aria-controls")!)!.hidden = !on;
    });
  tabs.forEach((t, i) => {
    t.addEventListener("click", () => select(t));
    t.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
      const d = e.key === "ArrowRight" ? 1 : e.key === "ArrowLeft" ? -1 : 0;
      if (!d) return;
      const next = tabs[(i + d + tabs.length) % tabs.length];
      select(next);
      next.focus();
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .way { padding-block: var(--sp-block); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .way:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .gap { margin-top: var(--sp-item); }
  .gap-s { margin-top: 16px; }
  .vis { display: grid; gap: 32px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; }

  .route svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .route-ends { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 6px; }
  .ticks { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: var(--gap); }
  .ticks li { display: grid; gap: 4px; align-content: start; }
  .bar { display: block; height: 2px; background: var(--rule); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: left; }
  .a .bar i { background: var(--stamp); }
  .ticks b { font: 500 0.875rem/1.5 var(--mono); }
  .a b { color: var(--stamp); }

  .call { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: var(--sp-item); align-items: center; }
  .call svg { width: 120px; height: 120px; }
  .cut { opacity: 0; }

  .langs { display: flex; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .langs button { font: 500 var(--fs-small)/1.4 var(--sans); padding: 0 0 3px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; background: none; color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
  .langs button[aria-selected="true"] { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); }
</style>
